   `process 744 (root, up 40-03:29:52): /usr/sbin/ser2net -c /etc/ser2net.conf -P /run/ser2net.pid`
   — the box's own console daemon, the identical item the Test Engineer adjudicated "Proceed"
   for the 2026-10-20 campaign and which the campaign queue records as still standing for this
   one. Nothing was displaced. The Test Engineer's own login on pts/1 is information only.
2. **No console parked mid-state.** `tools/tb peek` (one bare CR, types no word) on each:
   `/dev/u2 TAIL: 'awplus login:'`, `/dev/u3 TAIL: 'awplus login:'`,
