   (capture `2026-10-20T230259Z`), which is the only description of this box.
4. **Probe, `--read-only`, against the run `.setup`.** 🔴 Run with `--read-only` deliberately:
   `bench_probe.py` switches `lldp run` on by itself without it, and the 11:59 triage probe ran
   without it — so `lldp run` being on in the DUT's running-config might have been probe
   residue rather than the bench baseline. **That question is now settled; see "Was `lldp run`
   probe residue?" below.**

   ```
   tools/tb probe tb277 --consoles u2,u3,u5 --no-prompt --read-only \
        --pdu 10.36.230.212 --outlet u2=1 --outlet u3=7 --outlet u5=3@10.36.230.35 \
