Default: Bridge Id 8000:e01aead47043

Port            Designated Bridge    Port Id    Role             State
port1.0.2       8000:0000cd423029    838a       Rootport         Forwarding
port1.0.4       8000:889d98df2602    838c       Alternate        Discarding
port1.0.10      8000:e01aead47043    8392       Designated       Forwarding
port1.0.14      8000:889d98df2602    8396       Alternate        Discarding
