   `Current boot image : flash:/x960-tb277.rel (file exists)`,
   `Current boot config: flash:/default.cfg (file exists)`, `Autoboot status : disabled`.
4. **The subject's own state** closed as it opened:
   ```
   awplus#show lldp
     LLDP Status ............... Enabled     [Disabled]
